				<wikidot:authorName>swiftes</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5992813</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>1. This SCP is only linked to Sarkicism in some canons. While Sarkics utilise it, they seemingly did not create it. The original author would’ve revised this page to say so if otherwise.</p> <p>2. Both Grand Karcist Ion and Robert Bumaro are both implied to desire to aid humanity. However, their methods of doing so are both incredibly dangerous and they also seem to intend on reshaping humanity in their own images. It’s one of those “road to hell is paved with good intentions” things.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
