					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-146191#post-4328758</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-146191/scp-610#post-4328758</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2019 15:23:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Elogee FishTruck</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4037075</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Sarkicism is a Group of Interest created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/metaphysician" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1698079&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1565623411" alt="Metaphysician" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1698079)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/metaphysician" >Metaphysician</a></span>. It is inspired by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1565623411" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span>'s <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2217">SCP-2217</a>, which heavily features <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-610">SCP-610</a> as an enemy of the Church of the Broken God. It's one of the more interesting GoIs out there, with many SCPs related to it and a grand mythos. To quote from the Sarkicism hub:</p> <blockquote> <p>Sarkicism is a religious/philosophical system that encompasses a variety of traditions, beliefs, and spiritual practices largely based on teachings attributed to “Grand Karcist Ion”, its deified founder. Adherents practice ritual cannibalism, human sacrifice, corporeal augmentation, thaumaturgy, and dimensional manipulation.</p> </blockquote> <p>For more information, please read the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/sarkicism-hub">Sarkicism Hub</a>, which is highly detailed on the religious practices of the Sarkics.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
