						 <blockquote> <p>610 is Yaldabaoth, the God1 of the Sarkics, incarnated as pestilence.</p> </blockquote> <p>Is it though? I mean 610 predates the creation of the Sarkics as a concept by several years (and indeed lacks a Sarkic tag). It's all headcanon of course but I've always felt it does a disservice to the original author to rope it into the Sarkic's mythology when it was intended as it's own thing.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
