				<wikidot:authorName>Alan Stock</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2813598</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Enjoyed this one, I like Nekos entries because they tell the story through field reports. But please Neko, I want more! Will you ever write the 6th appendix? I know you wanted role play but I'm clamouring for any other little nuggets about this weirdass infection.</p> <p>Btw I would consider removing the bit where the team cuts off a bit of infected tissue in the tunnel and lets it go down the river. Even though we know that water sources aren't contaminated by it, considering how terrible this infection is, it stretches belief that the team would be so unprofessional to let a bit of the infection potentially head off to god knows where down the river, perhaps to outside of the containment zone.</p> <p>I wouldn't mind seeing a few more entries on this SCP, maybe with a few more instances of the giant head or other weird huge body horror tied into the under-village.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
